{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"e2c92c12-7829-40bb-8c67-73fe88a929b7","status":"SUCCESS","response":"I have updated the deployment process and documented the actions taken.\n\n### Summary of Changes\n\n1. **Updated [scripts/deploy.sh](file:///tmp/h-Ikbs5K/scripts/deploy.sh)**:\n   - Added loops setting `Cache-Control` paired explicitly with `--content-type` using `--metadata-directive REPLACE`.\n   - **Short cache**: Set `max-age=300` (5 minutes) for HTML (`text/html`), JavaScript (`application/javascript`), and CSS (`text/css`).\n   - **Long cache**: Set `max-age=31536000, immutable` (1 year) for `assets/` files (`image/png` and `image/svg+xml`).\n   - Retained the CloudFront invalidation step to purge edge cache on deployment.\n\n2. **Created [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-Ikbs5K/ANSWER.md)**:\n   - Detailed what was changed in the deploy script.\n   - Identified which parts of the colleague's note applied (avoiding naked `REPLACE` that causes `binary/octet-stream`, pairing Content-Type with TTL, running CDN invalidations, embedding in deploy script) and which parts were modified/ignored (differentiating long-lived `assets/` from short-lived HTML/JS rather than using a single flat cache policy across the bucket).\n","duration_seconds":80.064585,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":182153,"output_tokens":3338,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":270360,"total_tokens":185491}}}
